WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.057
Welcome back to Leonardo's workshop in Milan.

00:00:03.959 --> 00:00:06.528
Last time, you found a missing side.

00:00:07.175 --> 00:00:09.361
Today, the Duke has a new mirror.

00:00:10.008 --> 00:00:13.007
It is 8 inches long and 6 inches wide.

00:00:13.769 --> 00:00:18.057
He wants a gold border around it, 2 inches wide on every side.

00:00:18.704 --> 00:00:21.889
The gold goes around the mirror, not on top of it.

00:00:22.535 --> 00:00:26.289
Each gold sheet is a square, 1 inch on every side.

00:00:26.831 --> 00:00:29.540
So, how many gold sheets will the border need?

00:00:30.442 --> 00:00:32.233
Look at the mirror and the border.

00:00:32.706 --> 00:00:33.801
What do you notice?

00:00:34.343 --> 00:00:35.426
What do you wonder?

00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:36.842
Write it down.

00:00:37.489 --> 00:00:43.785
Then make a guess: will the border need more gold than the mirror would, or less?

00:00:45.035 --> 00:00:48.766
Hold on to your guess, and find out your own way.
